For the material **{MATERIAL}**, provide derivation-chain information using the following strict JSON format:

{
  "id": "{material-id}",
  "derived_from": ["direct predecessors"],
  "makes": ["direct successors"],
  "alternative_paths": [
    ["variant", "intermediate", "chain"],
    ["another", "pathway"]
  ]
}

Definitions:
- "derived_from": materials that directly lead to this one.
- "makes": materials that can be created from this one.
- "alternative_paths": full multi-step pathways or variations (A → B → C).

Rules:
- All keys must be present.
- If no data exists, use empty lists.
- Keep item names simple (single words when possible).
